<title>INDIA: India Bajaj Auto to meet on May 19 for bonus issue.</title>
<headline>India Bajaj Auto to meet on May 19 for bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian scooter giant Bajaj Auto said on Wednesday its board will meet on May 19 to consider a bonus equity issue.</p>
<p>The board also decided to recommend a dividend of 10 rupees per share of 10-rupee face value for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
